<!--
  Kira :ui design-system string catalog (Phase 11.ui.UP-3 — localization recovery).

  Rework :ui screens resolve user-facing text through compose-resources
  `stringResource(Res.string.<key>)` instead of hardcoded literals. Key names mirror the legacy
  `composeApp/.../composeResources/values/strings.xml` catalog wherever a string overlaps, so the
  already-authored translations (values-ar + 9 other locales) can be reused verbatim.

  Locale resolution: compose-resources picks `values-<lang>/strings.xml` from the active app/system
  locale (driven by :platform LocaleSwitcher). RTL mirroring is automatic from the resolved locale.

  Grow this file per-screen as UP-3 extracts each surface (Welcome first, pilot).
-->
